Behaviour patch, PENDING RULING (ledger/0002-withdrawscenarioof-tcl.md): the original's
WithdrawScenarioOf is missing a `[`, so every head entering the "play" state raises a Tcl
error. Under -s N startup that error is fatal, so without this patch the session oracle
cannot start a scenario at all. Applied provisionally; Jon to rule reproduce vs. fix.
--- a/res/micropolis.tcl
+++ b/res/micropolis.tcl
@@ -3161,7 +3161,7 @@
 
 
 proc WithdrawScenarioOf {head} {
-  set win WindowLink $head.scenario]
+  set win [WindowLink $head.scenario]
   if {$win != {}} {
     wm withdraw $win
   }
